    "detailed_description": "&quot;One of the best games of the year! You owe it to yourself to play it.&quot; - Noclip<br><br>&quot;Typecast offers a truly modernized arcade gameplay experience. It can be played forever, and can genuinely last as long as there is air in your lungs and hatred in your heart.&quot; - A Dedicated Fan<br><br>&quot;Super simple arcade game that has been polished into the impossible.&quot; - Some Guy Who Left A Steam Review<br><br>&quot;Please remove me from your mailing list.&quot; - A Press Outlet Who Will Remain Unnamed<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pure Arcade Bliss</strong></h2>No meta progression, no roguelike or roguelite elements, no nonsense. Meta progress your own brain as your skills increase and you climb the leaderboards.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ultra Precise Movement</strong></h2>Your mouse is your character. Weave in and out of hordes of enemies with perfect precision!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Type To Shoot</strong></h2>Each enemy has a specific letter that you must type in order to destroy them. Be careful, typing the wrong key can have dire consequences!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Endless Onslaught</strong></h2>Enemies never stop coming. Fight them off for as long as you can and go for the high score!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Deep Mechanics</strong></h2>Use slow-mo, bombs, parries, and more to destroy your enemies and climb to the top of the leaderboards!",
    "about_the_game": "&quot;One of the best games of the year! You owe it to yourself to play it.&quot; - Noclip<br><br>&quot;Typecast offers a truly modernized arcade gameplay experience. It can be played forever, and can genuinely last as long as there is air in your lungs and hatred in your heart.&quot; - A Dedicated Fan<br><br>&quot;Super simple arcade game that has been polished into the impossible.&quot; - Some Guy Who Left A Steam Review<br><br>&quot;Please remove me from your mailing list.&quot; - A Press Outlet Who Will Remain Unnamed<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pure Arcade Bliss</strong></h2>No meta progression, no roguelike or roguelite elements, no nonsense. Meta progress your own brain as your skills increase and you climb the leaderboards.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ultra Precise Movement</strong></h2>Your mouse is your character. Weave in and out of hordes of enemies with perfect precision!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Type To Shoot</strong></h2>Each enemy has a specific letter that you must type in order to destroy them. Be careful, typing the wrong key can have dire consequences!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Endless Onslaught</strong></h2>Enemies never stop coming. Fight them off for as long as you can and go for the high score!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Deep Mechanics</strong></h2>Use slow-mo, bombs, parries, and more to destroy your enemies and climb to the top of the leaderboards!",
    "short_description": "TYPECAST is a bullet hell where you type to shoot. Get swarmed by enemies, manage the chaos, and climb the leaderboards in this unique arcade experience.",
